# WSL for GPU work

- Run training/encode/Phase0 from WSL Ubuntu, not native Windows Python.
- Working dir: `/mnt/c/projects/tts-self`, activate `.venv`, set `HF_HOME=$HOME/hf_cache`.
- If shell quoting breaks under PowerShell, use `wsl -d Ubuntu --cd /mnt/c/projects/tts-self -e bash -lc '...'`.
- See skill `wsl-env` for bootstrap and cache permission fixes.
